  "description": "Ji Sunjeong knows exactly how cruel the world can be, especially for an omega scraping by at the absolute bottom. But nothing prepares him for the night he steps into a dark alley and watches the city’s most beloved billionaire philanthropist, Beom Seongheon, brutally beat a man half to death. Disgusted by the alpha’s saintly facade, Sunjeong decides to leverage the secret in order to secure his freedom. Surprisingly, Seongheon easily plays along, opening his wallet and pulling Sunjeong into his orbit. But Seongheon isn't without his own reasons. Both believe they hold the leash in this toxic game of mutual exploitation, but as their cold-blooded transaction spirals into a breathless attraction, the line between hunter and prey begins to vanish...\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/perfect_error), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/perfect_error)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://www.lezhinus.com/en/comic/perfecterror), [Spanish](https://www.lezhin.es/detail/perfect-error), [French](https://www.lezhinfr.com/detail/bt_11113466), [German](https://www.lezhinde.com/detail/dbd_00553), [T.Chinese](https://www.bomtoon.tw/detail/perfect_error), [Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/perfect_error), [Japanese](https://www.beltoon.jp/detail/perfect_error)\n\n##### Note: All official translations are uncensored, except for Japanese. This series is a global release, meaning all official translations come out on the same day as the original Korean.",
